            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"section-0-global-configuration\">Section 0 \u2014 Global configuration</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Single source of truth for the whole notebook. Downstream cells read these\ncontrols, so dragging a slider re-runs sampling, QA, splits and results.\nExpensive steps additionally sit behind run buttons so nothing heavy fires\non an accidental drag.</span></span>"
